      "comment": "Mr. Nine: Nicole and the creation of Mr. Nine",
      "content": "Nicole wanted to be an author but found writing tedious. She told her story ideas to an old Seelie friend, a former Angel, who possessed sleepers who dreamed of making worlds and wrote them down. They made up Mr. Nine, with a receding hairline, as the author.\n\nIn the 6.2 quest Nicole sent her to monitor Nod-Krai. The two argue about first-author credit.",
