      "comment": "Mr. Nine: Flowers for Princess Fischl",
      "content": "Flowers for Princess Fischl is Mr. Nine's book series, sold in Inazuma. Fischl based her persona on its title character. One metaphor about creating life is half-true: Nicole says 30 percent true, Mr. Nine says 10. Fischl used it to create Oz.\n\nThe editor-in-chief adds in a book note that readers may interpret the characters' relationships however they like.",
