      "comment": "Mr. Nine: Royalties and Chang the Ninth",
      "content": "Chang the Ninth is a struggling Qingce Village writer who denies being Mr. Nine. Mr. Nine says a share of her royalties, split 90-10, is buried in his yard; the Traveler digs up a bag of Mora and a Northland Bank check there.",
